## Step 2: Create a Get Devices Request

1. Create a new request.
2. Set the method to **GET**.
3. Enter the URL:
   ```
   https://sandbox-sdwan-2.cisco.com/dataservice/device
   ```
4. Click **Save**.
5. Click **Send**.

> **Note:** Postman automatically includes the **JSESSIONID** cookie from the login request, so you don't need to add it manually.
